{
  "info": {
    "name": "EP3 - SmartLogix (JWT + API Gateway + SQS + Lambda)",
    "description": "Coleccion de pruebas de la EP3.\n\nCOMO USARLA\n1. Ejecuta primero la carpeta '0. Autenticacion': guarda los tokens en las\n   variables {{token}} (ADMIN) y {{operadorToken}} (OPERADOR).\n2. El resto de peticiones heredan el Bearer {{token}} de la coleccion.\n\nLOCAL vs NUBE\n- Local (docker compose): deja las variables users/inventory/orders como estan.\n- A traves del API Gateway: pon las TRES con la misma URL del Gateway, por ejemplo\n  https://abc123.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/prod\n\nSustituye a la cabecera X-User-Role de la EP2, que ya no existe.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "users",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001"
    },
    {
      "key": "inventory",
      "value": "http://localhost:3002"
    },
    {
      "key": "orders",
      "value": "http://localhost:3003"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "operadorToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "productoId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "productoId2",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "pedidoId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Autenticacion (ejecutar primero)",
      "description": "Obtiene los JWT. Sin esto, todo lo demas responde 401.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login ADMIN -> 200 + token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Devuelve un JWT\", () => pm.expect(b.token).to.be.a(\"string\").and.not.empty);",
                  "pm.test(\"El JWT tiene 3 partes\", () => pm.expect(b.token.split(\".\").length).to.eql(3));",
                  "pm.test(\"El rol es ADMIN\", () => pm.expect(b.rol).to.eql(\"ADMIN\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"Tipo Bearer\", () => pm.expect(b.tipo).to.eql(\"Bearer\"));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", b.token);",
                  "console.log(\"Token ADMIN guardado, expira en \" + b.expiraEnSegundos + \" s\");"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{users}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{users}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Unica ruta publica del sistema. Guarda el token en {{token}}.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usuario\": \"admin@smartlogix.cl\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login OPERADOR -> 200 + token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"El rol es OPERADOR\", () => pm.expect(b.rol).to.eql(\"OPERADOR\"));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"operadorToken\", b.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{users}}/api/auth/login",
